# turbopanel.sh no longer hosts a copy of the installer. Every path is a 301
# to the one source of truth on GitHub: scripts/run.sh on the `live` branch,
# which moves only when a release is promoted (see workers/turbopanel-sh/AGENTS.md).
# `curl -fsSL turbopanel.sh | sh` keeps working: -L follows the redirect, and
# every automatic-update consumer (tp-orchestrate, the daemon, run.sh re-exec)
# already fetches with -L. First match wins; the splat is the catch-all.
/ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TurboPanel/turbopaneld/live/scripts/run.sh 301
/run.sh https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TurboPanel/turbopaneld/live/scripts/run.sh 301
/bootstrap https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TurboPanel/turbopaneld/live/scripts/run.sh 301
/* https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TurboPanel/turbopaneld/live/scripts/run.sh 301
